ParentVault_claimAssetFor
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the user is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
├── when the epoch is not claimable
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotClaimable
├── when the user has no withdraw
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoWithdraw
└── when the claim is valid
    ├── anyone should be able to trigger it
    ├── it should transfer and emit only for the user
    └── it should burn escrowed shares and clear the position and counters
